Subject: [M150] [PDF] Prevent page unloading in
 PDFiumPage::GenerateThumbnail()

Original change's description:
> [PDF] Prevent page unloading in PDFiumPage::GenerateThumbnail()
>
> PDFs with JS can potentially trigger page unloading while
> GenerateThumbnail() is rendering. Use ScopedPageUnloadPreventer to make
> sure that does not happen.
>
